# Pin LF in the working tree. Without this, git's core.autocrlf=true (set on this
# machine) rewrites every file to CRLF on checkout, which then fails the
# `endOfLine: "lf"` rule in .prettierrc.json — `npm run format:check` would break
# on a fresh clone even though nobody edited anything.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.jpeg -text
*.woff -text
*.woff2 -text
*.ico -text
